.md
## Results

| Status | Skills |
|---|---|
| works | 59 |
| works with fixes | 1 (paclet-docs: approval step made a hard stop) |
| limited (external gap only) | 6 |
| not tested (owner rule 0: needs Wolfram's servers) | 4 |
| **total** | **70** |

- **Limited:** backlog-autolab and paclet-publish (approval gate verified; the gated action needs the owner);
  create-wolfram-documentation, wolfram-demonstration, wolfram-paclet, wolfram-prompt (offline: category lists or a
  network service come from Wolfram's servers).
- **Not tested:** wolfram-alpha, astro-observation-planner, wolfram-function-resource, create-hydraulic-model.

95 skill invocations by fresh agents (31 superseded attempts kept as evidence) and 8 independent review rounds (reviewers A-H).

