## Defects found (all reproduced by hand; `tests/bugs/BUGS.md`)

- **Wolfram products:** W1 sample `Submarine.mo` does not build; W2 ServiceFramework refuses local services offline (the
  developers' own `What if the request does not need internet???` comment); W3 the documentation-build package tries a
  paclet download on load; W4 System Modeler AI toolkit draws diagram lines to wrong connector pins; W5
  `FailedAssertions` reports 0 failures after one plain call.
- **WLJS (open source):** J1 kernel-side save raises a false "File hash mismatch" dialog (one-line fix, applied and
  verified); J2 dialogs open on the primary monitor (fixed); J3 a kernel-side save does not store graphics, so plots
  show "Loading..." after a restart (confirmed; patch proposed, awaiting the owner's OK).
- **Wolfram Institute examples:** I1 stray `General::stop` cells from the example build; I2 three defects in the
  DocPageExamples paclet; I3 four factual errors in the BlochSphereGates Demonstration; I4 the converter drops a symbol
  page's Keywords; I5 a category count of 34 that lists 35.

